{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107360","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1610736001:1":{"text":"Gervan, have you heard anything about students losing their magic lately?","source_cn":"格墨文，你最近是否听说过学生魔力消失的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F0E2E967FBC5132","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610736002:1":{"text":"Just rumors. They say some students caught a strange illness that caused all their magic to vanish. Even Professor Solise couldn't cure it.","source_cn":"听周围同学议论过。据说有些学生得了某种怪病，会导致全身...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E736A0674BC4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610736003:1":{"text":"Do you know anyone it's happened to?","source_cn":"只有这些吗？你身边是否有认识的人出现这种症状？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF20031D5CE3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610736004:1":{"text":"No, sir. Not personally.","source_cn":"应该没有，我认识的人没有出现过这种病症的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA58B1B45E3627223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610736005:1":{"text":"I see. You have a lot of pull with the other students. If you hear anything new, I expect to be informed immediately.","source_cn":"嗯……我知道了。你在学